 wote wa Amerika, wa zamani na kisasa, wanatokana na uhamiaji mmoja wa Wainuit, ambao waliwasili Amerika kwa takriban miaka 13,000 iliyopita.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mgawanyiko kati ya wenyeji wa Siberia na Wenyeji wa kwanza kabisa wa Amerika ulitokea wakati fulani kati ya miaka ya 20,000 na 23,000 iliyopita.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Mgawanyiko kati ya wenyeji wa Siberia na Wenyeji wa kwanza kabisa wa Amerika ulitokea wakati fulani kati ya miaka ya 20,000 na 23,000 iliyopita. [Subject: Prehistory · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>c81b2ae42e98dd96cc6a...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248379 · SUBGENCORE_Q507834</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Nutrition</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Nutrition (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Nutrition</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Je, ni nini athari za utandawazi katika usalama wa chakula?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ruzuku za nchi tajiri na vikwazo vya kibiashara hufanya iwe vigumu kwa nchi zinazoendelea kuchukua fursa ya uwezekano wa utandawazi katika kuendeleza usalama wa chakula.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Sheria za Shirika la Biashara Ulimwenguni hazihusu kilimo, kwa hivyo utandawazi hauathiri usalama wa chakula.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Maduka makubwa ndiyo njia pekee hadi sasa ambayo chakula na kilimo vimepitia utandawazi.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Nchi zinazoendelea zinahitaji kuunda akiba ya chakula inayomilikiwa na umma ili kufikia faida zinazowezekana.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Ruzuku za nchi tajiri na vikwazo vya kibiashara hufanya iwe vigumu kwa nchi zinazoendelea kuchukua fursa ya uwezekano wa utandawazi katika kuendeleza usalama wa chakula. [Subject: Nutrition · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>5043e81a42f0ce2c7928...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    "}
